| disk, best-eta mode | 0.7124 | 0.0275 | 0.04 | 1.097e-02 | 171.65 | 85.05 | 0.491 | 8.258e-05 |
| disk, best-energy mode | 0.7124 | 0.0275 | 0.04 | 1.097e-02 | 171.65 | 85.05 | 0.491 | 8.258e-05 |
| optimized (gray densities) | 0.6241 | 0.2320 | 0.37 | 1.097e-02 | 165.00 | 14.91 | 0.953 | 7.845e-05 |
| optimized (binary, connected) | 0.6392 | 0.2254 | 0.35 | 1.097e-02 | 168.69 | 13.08 | 0.957 | 8.047e-05 |

- **eta ratio, optimized (binary, connected) vs disk's best-eta mode: 0.983, so INCONCLUSIVE (within 5%)**
